    "long_instructions": "## Pattern Recognition\r\n\r\nSpot repeated code patterns and combine them into one reusable function.\r\n* **Test:** Click each button and notice what repeats.\r\n* **Plan:** Decide on one function that performs that shared action.\r\n* **Create:** Define a named arrow function that updates the output; give it a parameter for the changing part.\r\n* **Refactor:** Replace the repeated lines with calls to your new function.\r\n* **Verify:** Each button still works exactly the same.\r\n* **\r\nUse AI to Help You\r\n\r\n* Check your plan: “Does my function body include only the repeated part?”\r\n* Ask it to highlight what stays the same vs. what changes in your code.\r\n* Compare: “Did I keep the behavior identical for every button?”\r\n* Have it suggest 2–3 clearer names; keep only what makes sense to you.\r\n* **\r\nCompare Your Functions to Ones Created By AI \r\n* Ask AI to create a function for the same task and compare your refactored function to one generated by AI. Which is clearer or easier to understand?",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <title>L4–L3 · Pattern Recognition</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <h1>Message Board</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Find the pattern in these buttons, then simplify it.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"container card\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button id=\"btnHello\"   class=\"btn\">Say Hello</button>\n      <button id=\"btnWelcome\" class=\"btn\">Say Welcome</button>\n      <button id=\"btnGoodJob\" class=\"btn\">Say Good Job</button>\n      <button id=\"btnGoodbye\" class=\"btn\">Say Goodbye</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <div id=\"output\" class=\"output\"></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <small>Pattern Recognition</small>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* Base */\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-family: \"Gill Sans\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: #1f1433;          /* deep eggplant */\n  background: #faf5ff;     /* very light lavender */\n}\n\n.site-header {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 20px 12px;\n  background: #f3e8ff;     /* pale lilac band */\n}\n\n.site-header h1 {\n  margin: 6px 0;\n  color: #6d28d9;          /* purple */\n}\n\n.lede {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: #7c3aed;          /* purple-600 */\n}\n\n.container {\n  max-width: 720px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: #ffffff;\n  border: 1px solid #e7e0f7; /* soft violet-gray */\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 18px;\n}\n\n/* Buttons row  */\n.row {\n  margin: 0 0 12px 0;\n}\n\n.btn {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin: 6px 6px 0 0;\n  padding: 10px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid #c9b6f2;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #ede9fe;     /* light lavender */\n  color: #4c1d95;          /* indigo-purple */\n  font-weight: 700;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  background: #e3ddfd;\n}\n\n/* Output */\n.output {\n  min-height: 36px;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 1px dashed #d4c8f6;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #fbfaff;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* Footer */\n.site-footer {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 18px 12px;\n  color: #7c3aed;\n}\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// — Element references \nconst output      = document.getElementById(\"output\");\nconst btnHello    = document.getElementById(\"btnHello\");\nconst btnWelcome  = document.getElementById(\"btnWelcome\");\nconst btnGoodJob  = document.getElementById(\"btnGoodJob\");\nconst btnGoodbye  = document.getElementById(\"btnGoodbye\");\n\n// — Event listeners \nbtnHello.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  output.textContent = \"Hello!\";\n});\n\nbtnWelcome.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  output.textContent = \"Welcome!\";\n});\n\nbtnGoodJob.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  output.textContent = \"Good job!\";\n});\n\nbtnGoodbye.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n  output.textContent = \"Goodbye!\";\n});\n\n\n",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "3"
      ]
    },
